    68	 * assembler iterates. Annotated `Record<SliceKey, …>` so TS forces it to carry EXACTLY the
    69	 * observation slices (a dropped/renamed slice is a compile error); a Python parity test
    70	 * asserts it equals `_SLICE_FIELDS`.
    71	 */
